### ChatConfig

```ts
interface ChatConfig<TAdapters> {
  userName: string;
  adapters: TAdapters;
  state: StateAdapter;
  logger?: Logger | LogLevel;
  streamingUpdateIntervalMs?: number;
  dedupeTtlMs?: number;
  fallbackStreamingPlaceholderText?: string | null;
}
```

- `dedupeTtlMs`: deduplicates repeated webhook deliveries.
