| **Cloud Recording** | Record sessions to Zoom cloud |
| **Live Streaming** | Stream to RTMP endpoints |
| **Chat** | Send/receive chat messages |
| **Command Channel** | Custom command messaging |
| **Live Transcription** | Real-time speech-to-text |
